Error [E1102]: this task returns `fn(Int) => Int`, which isn't sendable
  --> tests/ui/task_spawn_parameters.jet:2:15
    |
  2 |     t :: task (x: Int) => x
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: the closure holds state that cannot cross this boundary; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: give the task plain owned data, or rebuild the value as an owned copy before spawning

Error [E0405]: the fallback is Int (a whole number), but the success value is fn(Int) => Int
  --> tests/ui/task_spawn_parameters.jet:3:23
    |
  3 |     print(t.join() ?? 0)
    |                       ^
 Why: both sides of `??` must be the same type
 Fix: use fn(Int) => Int here

Error [E0112]: `print` doesn't know how to show fn(Int) => Int
  --> tests/ui/task_spawn_parameters.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     print(t.join() ?? 0)
    |             ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: print shows values that have a display
 Fix: print one of its parts instead
